WEBVTT

00:00:05.730 --> 00:00:07.940
A tea party, you say?

00:00:07.940 --> 00:00:10.650
Yup. You should join us, Eririn.

00:00:10.650 --> 00:00:12.360
May I?

00:00:12.360 --> 00:00:16.280
Another person or two won't make a difference.

00:00:16.280 --> 00:00:19.370
Really? Then I'll extend an invitation to Shiro, as well.

00:00:19.370 --> 00:00:22.250
I'll be looking forward to it, Hasekura-kun.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:25.420
Why is the VP so close to him?

00:00:25.420 --> 00:00:26.130
Could they...

00:00:26.130 --> 00:00:28.880
...Have developed an intimacy after seeing each other naked?!

00:00:29.960 --> 00:00:31.380
Unforgivable.

00:00:31.380 --> 00:00:33.880
You two are attracting lots of attention.

00:00:33.880 --> 00:00:40.680
Can't help it, since the victim and the offender of the girls' bath peeping incident are walking together.

00:00:40.680 --> 00:00:42.270
Onee-chan, your volume...

00:00:42.270 --> 00:00:43.600
That was-

00:00:43.600 --> 00:00:46.730
It was a prank set up by the President!

00:00:46.730 --> 00:00:48.520
Who set what up?

00:00:48.520 --> 00:00:49.570
President!

00:00:49.570 --> 00:00:53.320
I'm very happy to see you two have made up.

00:00:53.320 --> 00:00:57.490
Hasekura-kun. She's not the best in the world, but I hope you take good care of my sister.

00:00:57.490 --> 00:00:59.530
Stop joking around so early in the morning!

00:00:59.530 --> 00:01:03.290
Hasekura-kun! You'll be late if you actually listen to him.

00:01:05.080 --> 00:01:07.920
You have a tasty-looking neck, Hasekura-kun.

00:01:08.880 --> 00:01:12.300
Please keep those creepy jokes to yourself.

00:01:12.300 --> 00:01:16.300
Oh, come on. I was pretty serious with that one.

00:01:17.890 --> 00:01:19.550
Kouhei-kun. You need to hurry.

00:01:19.550 --> 00:01:20.640
Yeah.

00:01:20.640 --> 00:01:24.060
Prez, please restrain yourself with respect to the number of pranks you attempt.

00:01:31.060 --> 00:01:34.600
Kizunairo kokoro to kokoro

00:01:31.060 --> 00:01:34.600
The color of bonds binding hearts to hearts

00:01:34.600 --> 00:01:37.810
Yakusoku no basho kitto michibiku wa

00:01:34.600 --> 00:01:37.810
Will surely lead us to the Promised Land.

00:01:38.150 --> 00:01:42.070
Tsutaetai tsutaekirenai

00:01:38.150 --> 00:01:42.070
I want to tell you, but I can't.

00:01:42.070 --> 00:01:46.070
Hatenai omoi ha anata...

00:01:42.070 --> 00:01:46.070
I always long for you...

00:01:51.910 --> 00:01:56.500
Boukansha no hibi ni yuuki wo dashitara sayonara

00:01:51.910 --> 00:01:56.500
Say goodbye to the days of just being a bystander.

00:01:58.040 --> 00:02:05.550
Demo "jiyuu" no teigi ni buranko no you ni yureteru no ne?

00:01:58.040 --> 00:02:05.550
But am I swaying over the meaning of "Freedom", like a swing?

00:02:06.220 --> 00:02:10.680
Gosenfu ni kaita kaidan

00:02:06.220 --> 00:02:10.680
Stairs drawn on a music score,

00:02:10.680 --> 00:02:14.180
Ippo susunde niho sagattemo

00:02:10.680 --> 00:02:14.180
Even if I go down one step and back two steps,

00:02:14.180 --> 00:02:18.190
Honno chotto setsunasa utau

00:02:14.180 --> 00:02:18.190
The notes play a sad melody.

00:02:18.190 --> 00:02:21.230
Watashi no real kanjite ne

00:02:18.190 --> 00:02:21.230
Hear my reality!

00:02:21.690 --> 00:02:25.150
Kizunairo kokoro to kokoro

00:02:21.690 --> 00:02:25.150
The color of bonds binding hearts to hearts

00:02:25.150 --> 00:02:28.700
Yakusoku no basho kitto michibikuwa

00:02:25.150 --> 00:02:28.700
Will surely lead us to the Promised Land.

00:02:28.700 --> 00:02:32.660
Tsutaetai tsutaekirenai

00:02:28.700 --> 00:02:32.660
I want to tell you, but can't

00:02:32.660 --> 00:02:36.080
Zutto anata wo sagashiteta

00:02:32.660 --> 00:02:36.080
I've always been searching for you.

00:02:36.700 --> 00:02:40.170
Tatoeba sou anataga hikari

00:02:36.700 --> 00:02:40.170
Let's say you are the light

00:02:40.170 --> 00:02:43.630
Watashi ga kagede mitsume aetanara

00:02:40.170 --> 00:02:43.630
And I'm the shadow, gazing at one other.

00:02:43.630 --> 00:02:47.670
Namida iro no diamond

00:02:43.630 --> 00:02:47.670
The tear-colored diamond

00:02:47.670 --> 00:02:51.470
Nee zero kara kagayakasetai

00:02:47.670 --> 00:02:51.470
I want to make it shine from nothing.

00:02:51.470 --> 00:02:57.020
Kowagaranaide musunde ne ai wo

00:02:51.470 --> 00:02:57.020
Don't be afraid of falling in love.

00:02:57.020 --> 00:02:59.190
Deaiwo...

00:02:57.020 --> 00:02:59.190
Nor of meeting people...

00:03:01.200 --> 00:03:05.370
Millennium Fountain

00:03:11.790 --> 00:03:14.000
Hey! Kouhei!

00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:16.050
Over here, over here!

00:03:17.340 --> 00:03:21.050
What's this? Fried noodles with no ginger again?

00:03:21.050 --> 00:03:21.930
Yeah.

00:03:21.930 --> 00:03:27.010
Kouhei-kun. It's not good for you to eat the same thing every day.

00:03:27.010 --> 00:03:28.600
That's true.

00:03:34.020 --> 00:03:36.110
Is it a little more balanced now?

00:03:36.110 --> 00:03:38.530
Oh, Kouhei-kun.

00:03:38.530 --> 00:03:41.110
I'll give you some of my salad.

00:03:41.110 --> 00:03:44.320
To share your valuable salad with others!

00:03:44.320 --> 00:03:46.910
You're the best, Hina-chan!

00:03:47.620 --> 00:03:49.120
Onee-chan.

00:03:50.250 --> 00:03:51.790
Wow, look at that.

00:03:57.630 --> 00:04:00.050
She's a spice-a-holic.

00:04:00.050 --> 00:04:02.090
It goes beyond that, I think.

00:04:11.020 --> 00:04:15.520
How will contestant Kirikiri overcome this situation?!

00:04:15.520 --> 00:04:16.810
Kirikiri?

00:04:16.810 --> 00:04:19.070
Oh right. Kuze Kiriha.

00:04:19.650 --> 00:04:21.940
It's best to get it exchanged.

00:04:21.940 --> 00:04:23.570
I'll go talk to Kuze-san.

00:04:23.570 --> 00:04:25.990
I think it's too late for that.

00:04:30.790 --> 00:04:32.960
That's the Freeze Dry we know.

00:04:42.720 --> 00:04:45.510
You should watch with me, Kouhei!

00:04:46.680 --> 00:04:48.140
The Yokozuna Detective

00:04:46.720 --> 00:04:48.140
Dosukoi<i>%</i>

00:04:47.010 --> 00:04:48.140
13th Round

00:04:47.010 --> 00:04:48.140
「I have no need for other Tsuppari

00:04:47.010 --> 00:04:48.140
as long as I have my Tsuppari」

00:04:47.720 --> 00:04:50.390
Dosukoi! Detective Yokozuna.

00:04:50.390 --> 00:04:58.440
Under the suit is the mawashi~

00:04:58.440 --> 00:05:06.360
It's a game of trickery between men and women~

00:05:07.950 --> 00:05:09.870
What is with this song?

00:05:09.870 --> 00:05:11.540
You never heard it before?

00:05:11.540 --> 00:05:15.000
It the opening theme of
Detective Yokozuna, Chonmage Dandyism.

00:05:15.000 --> 00:05:16.790
I've never heard it before.

00:05:17.750 --> 00:05:20.630
You're so closed off to the world, aren't you?

00:05:20.630 --> 00:05:24.470
No, your hobbies are too niche.

00:05:24.470 --> 00:05:26.510
Nuppio, was it?

00:05:26.510 --> 00:05:28.510
You liked strange characters when you were little, too.

00:05:28.510 --> 00:05:31.890
What? Nuppio's cute.

00:05:33.140 --> 00:05:34.850
Tada!

00:05:34.850 --> 00:05:37.810
Wow, that brings back memories.

00:05:37.810 --> 00:05:39.730
You still have that, huh?

00:05:39.730 --> 00:05:43.150
Yup. Hina-chan liked it, too, remember?

00:05:45.860 --> 00:05:48.160
There you are, Kouhei-kun.

00:05:48.740 --> 00:05:51.200
What are you two doing, staring into each other's eyes?

00:05:56.830 --> 00:06:04.210
It's a game of trick between men and women~

00:06:09.890 --> 00:06:11.010
Good evening.

00:06:11.970 --> 00:06:13.600
Hello.

00:06:13.600 --> 00:06:17.850
Welcome to the tea party in Kouhei's room!

00:06:21.560 --> 00:06:24.020
Make yourself comfortable wherever you like.

00:06:24.780 --> 00:06:27.780
So this is Hasekura-senpai's room...

00:06:27.780 --> 00:06:31.950
I had imagined a boy's room would be more cluttered.

00:06:31.950 --> 00:06:34.080
I don't own many things.

00:06:34.080 --> 00:06:37.580
Yeah, you might want to decorate the room a little more.

00:06:37.580 --> 00:06:41.710
In that case, how does arranging some flowers sound?

00:06:41.710 --> 00:06:44.750
I don't think that's very fitting in a guy's room.

00:06:44.750 --> 00:06:47.340
But you should have a little more of something.

00:06:51.300 --> 00:06:52.220
Let me help.

00:06:53.470 --> 00:06:55.220
Thank you, Sendo-san.

00:06:55.970 --> 00:06:57.220
Please.

00:07:09.990 --> 00:07:15.370
Okay! Tomorrow's a weekend, so to tighten
the bonds between this tea party's members,

00:07:15.370 --> 00:07:17.490
we'll all go to downtown together!

00:07:17.490 --> 00:07:22.370
It'll be the "Bring Coziness to Kouhei's Room" tour!

00:07:25.000 --> 00:07:27.300
Hasekura-senpai, you have bed hair.

00:07:27.300 --> 00:07:29.470
Big sis will fix it for you!

00:07:34.600 --> 00:07:37.100
Thank you. Is it fixed?

00:07:37.100 --> 00:07:38.310
No, I give up.

00:07:38.310 --> 00:07:40.270
In fact, it got worse.

00:07:40.270 --> 00:07:41.810
I'll take care of it later.

00:07:41.810 --> 00:07:45.400
Oh, so you're interested in fragrances, too?

00:07:45.400 --> 00:07:47.900
Yes, though not as much as you are.

00:07:47.900 --> 00:07:51.200
Let's go to the shop along the beach then.

00:07:51.200 --> 00:07:53.070
It's a shop dedicated to perfumes,

00:07:53.070 --> 00:07:55.240
and they even have a selection of bath soaps.

00:07:53.570 --> 00:07:57.080
Vice Prez and Haruna get along, don't they?

00:07:57.080 --> 00:07:59.040
It's a very girly conversation.

00:07:59.040 --> 00:08:01.330
Should we have a manly conversation?

00:08:01.910 --> 00:08:04.540
We should talk about beef bowls!

00:08:05.710 --> 00:08:09.880
I think Shiro-chan would be classified with them.

00:08:16.720 --> 00:08:16.760
When you make me
your stepping stone,
you will become strong!

00:08:32.360 --> 00:08:35.860
You stupid ocean!

00:08:36.320 --> 00:08:38.660
I'm joking! I'm joking! I'm sorry!

00:08:44.210 --> 00:08:46.960
It was another fun day.

00:08:48.090 --> 00:08:49.170
What is it?

00:08:49.170 --> 00:08:53.800
I thought it's very like you for today to be "another" fun day.

00:08:53.800 --> 00:08:56.800
Oh. Are you not enjoying every day?

00:09:07.400 --> 00:09:09.480
I enjoy every day, I guess.

00:09:10.770 --> 00:09:13.440
I'm glad I came to this island.

00:09:14.070 --> 00:09:14.900
I see.

00:09:16.450 --> 00:09:17.490
That's great.

00:09:22.450 --> 00:09:26.540
Hasekura-kun. Do you remember the other day?

00:09:27.750 --> 00:09:28.540
Yeah.

00:09:30.590 --> 00:09:36.930
Follow the hand you shook, and you'll find me and your friends that you can share fun times with.

00:09:38.680 --> 00:09:42.600
Let's create a fun school life together.

00:09:45.560 --> 00:09:46.310
Yeah.

00:09:47.100 --> 00:09:47.980
Except...

00:09:50.270 --> 00:09:52.070
...Be wary of my brother.

00:09:53.030 --> 00:09:54.570
Wary?

00:10:23.600 --> 00:10:26.230
Good morning, Hasekura-kun.

00:10:26.230 --> 00:10:28.100
P-Prez...

00:10:28.100 --> 00:10:30.650
What is that reaction for?

00:10:30.650 --> 00:10:32.110
I haven't done anything to you yet.

00:10:32.650 --> 00:10:33.980
"Yet"?

00:10:33.980 --> 00:10:35.860
So you're planning to.

00:10:35.860 --> 00:10:39.660
How cruel of you to view me with such suspicion.

00:10:39.660 --> 00:10:41.870
I was so looking forward to your-

00:10:40.910 --> 00:10:41.870
Excuse me.

00:10:42.280 --> 00:10:43.620
Hasekura-kun.

00:10:44.660 --> 00:10:45.950
Do you still have something for me?

00:10:46.580 --> 00:10:49.830
When the school lets out,
come to the Directing Students Room.

00:10:50.870 --> 00:10:51.880
Make sure you do.

00:10:56.170 --> 00:10:57.800
Where do you want to go?

00:10:58.260 --> 00:11:00.760
Hey, where's Kouhei-kun?

00:11:00.760 --> 00:11:01.640
I don't know.

00:11:01.640 --> 00:11:05.260
He left after saying there was something he had to take care of.

00:11:05.260 --> 00:11:06.350
I see.

00:11:07.220 --> 00:11:08.980
A game?

00:11:09.690 --> 00:11:15.110
Yes. I wanted to play a game with you today.

00:11:16.400 --> 00:11:18.070
You called me out here for something like that?

00:11:18.070 --> 00:11:23.570
Don't be like that. Let's get to know each other through playing a game.

00:11:24.990 --> 00:11:27.450
Please enjoy the tea.

00:11:31.370 --> 00:11:32.290
Shiro.

00:11:33.210 --> 00:11:36.420
You have Laurel Ring duties today, do you not?

00:11:37.420 --> 00:11:38.550
You don't have to be here.

00:11:38.550 --> 00:11:40.050
Okay.

00:11:46.390 --> 00:11:48.520
Let's begin.

00:12:00.940 --> 00:12:05.070
Player must invite another acquaintance for tea.

00:12:05.070 --> 00:12:08.740
Lucky me. I've already done this since I called you here.

00:12:08.740 --> 00:12:10.750
What is that?

00:12:10.750 --> 00:12:12.960
It's just as the card reads.

00:12:12.960 --> 00:12:15.750
What the card says is law.

00:12:17.090 --> 00:12:18.710
It's your turn.

00:12:19.210 --> 00:12:20.130
Okay.

00:12:30.220 --> 00:12:34.900
The player must accept the reality of what is about to take place.

00:12:36.730 --> 00:12:37.690
My turn.

00:12:41.150 --> 00:12:43.030
Oh, this isn't good.

00:12:43.030 --> 00:12:45.030
This is a penalty game.

00:12:45.660 --> 00:12:49.910
The player must stab the blade of truth into their own hand.

00:12:50.330 --> 00:12:52.040
"Into their own"?

00:12:52.040 --> 00:12:53.160
That's ridiculous.

00:12:53.160 --> 00:12:57.830
Unfortunately, I can't break the rule.

00:13:10.600 --> 00:13:11.140
President?

00:13:15.270 --> 00:13:16.650
I think I cleared that one.

00:13:17.440 --> 00:13:18.560
Cleared...

00:13:18.560 --> 00:13:20.480
What are you doing?!

00:13:20.480 --> 00:13:25.490
I told you what the card says is law, right?

00:13:26.910 --> 00:13:29.450
Besides, it's not that big of a deal.

00:13:38.540 --> 00:13:41.170
I'm this kind of creature.

00:13:46.300 --> 00:13:47.760
Hasekura-kun.

00:13:47.760 --> 00:13:51.430
Your neck really looks good.

00:13:53.890 --> 00:13:55.390
Nii-san.

00:14:18.170 --> 00:14:19.420
Hasekura-kun.

00:14:19.420 --> 00:14:20.630
Hasekura-kun!

00:14:22.130 --> 00:14:27.130
I'm sorry. It wasn't a good joke for you right now.

00:14:27.130 --> 00:14:28.260
Joke?

00:14:37.230 --> 00:14:39.600
I have no intention of feeding on your blood.

00:14:39.600 --> 00:14:45.150
But it's quite true that we're what people call vampires.

00:14:46.070 --> 00:14:50.070
W-Wait a minute. You just said "we".

00:14:50.070 --> 00:14:51.280
He's right.

00:14:57.080 --> 00:14:59.580
I'm just like him.

00:15:07.090 --> 00:15:11.340
We need you to properly accept this reality.

00:15:16.220 --> 00:15:18.480
But, this is ridiculous!

00:15:19.230 --> 00:15:21.980
I know it's hard to believe.

00:15:21.980 --> 00:15:27.360
Either way, since you've learned our secret, I can't let you just leave this place.

00:15:28.360 --> 00:15:29.440
Secret?

00:15:31.070 --> 00:15:36.080
So, Hasekura-kun. I want you to be part of the Student Council.

00:15:37.660 --> 00:15:39.290
Why me?

00:15:39.830 --> 00:15:42.040
A whim, I guess.

00:15:42.670 --> 00:15:45.540
The more the merrier for anything, right?

00:15:46.420 --> 00:15:48.510
What if I refuse?

00:15:49.300 --> 00:15:51.050
I will erase your memory.

00:15:52.010 --> 00:15:55.050
Just like I did to that girl the other day.

00:15:59.810 --> 00:16:06.520
In your case, though, I'll have to make you forget everything that's happened since you transferred here.

00:16:06.520 --> 00:16:08.690
Everything that's happened on this island?

00:16:08.690 --> 00:16:11.070
Yup. You'll be starting from square one.

00:16:16.280 --> 00:16:18.450
Starting from square one...

00:16:18.700 --> 00:16:21.080
Hasekura
Kouhei-kun

00:16:22.410 --> 00:16:26.080
Oh, that's easy.

00:16:22.710 --> 00:16:24.120
To Hasekura-kun

00:16:27.840 --> 00:16:30.630
It's the same as what I've been doing so far.

00:16:31.800 --> 00:16:37.850
Just do the same thing one more time and I can get out of this crazy reality.

00:16:42.730 --> 00:16:45.560
Yeah, it's easy.

00:16:45.560 --> 00:16:47.810
I just have to reset everything.

00:16:50.070 --> 00:16:50.820
Okay.

00:16:53.490 --> 00:16:55.280
Please erase my-

00:17:10.090 --> 00:17:11.760
Hasekura-kun.

00:17:18.050 --> 00:17:18.930
I'm sorry.

00:17:23.230 --> 00:17:25.770
Okay, that's fine.

00:17:25.770 --> 00:17:30.860
We don't need people who can't be
responsible for the life they've walked.

00:17:35.490 --> 00:17:38.280
Erika, I'll leave the rest to you.

00:17:38.280 --> 00:17:40.990
Why me?!

00:17:40.990 --> 00:17:43.830
Lend a hand to your friend's future.

00:17:43.830 --> 00:17:48.920
Looks like he wishes to be a bystander for the rest of his life.

00:17:51.170 --> 00:17:57.260
Hasekura-kun. At this school, only those with the will can enjoy their time here.

00:18:21.450 --> 00:18:23.080
Let me ask one last time.

00:18:23.990 --> 00:18:27.830
You won't change your mind?

00:18:27.830 --> 00:18:32.340
No. Just go ahead and do it.

00:18:34.340 --> 00:18:35.210
Okay.

00:18:45.270 --> 00:18:46.640
It'll be quick.

00:18:48.440 --> 00:18:49.310
You'll forget everything.

00:18:50.810 --> 00:18:53.320
Don't be afraid.

00:18:54.230 --> 00:18:56.530
So this is a vampire...

00:18:56.530 --> 00:18:57.690
Hasekura-kun.

00:19:02.950 --> 00:19:04.700
Don't take it personally.

00:19:29.640 --> 00:19:30.520
Why?

00:19:34.520 --> 00:19:35.770
It hurts!

00:19:37.360 --> 00:19:39.940
The fact I have to erase your memory...

00:19:39.940 --> 00:19:43.910
...there's a person who doesn't mind forgetting everything that's happened at this school...

00:19:43.910 --> 00:19:46.870
...and that person is my friend!

00:19:46.870 --> 00:19:50.460
Why did you come to this school?

00:19:50.460 --> 00:19:55.920
Were the days you spent at this school something you can let go of so easily?!

00:19:59.800 --> 00:20:01.670
Kouhei's taking his time.

00:20:01.670 --> 00:20:04.800
Was it all right for us to barge into his room like this?

00:20:04.800 --> 00:20:06.930
Kouhei will forgive us.

00:20:06.930 --> 00:20:09.350
We'll welcome him back together.

00:20:09.350 --> 00:20:09.930
Yup.

00:20:15.230 --> 00:20:16.940
It's about time it ended.

00:20:17.940 --> 00:20:20.940
Will Hasekura-senpai really lose his memories?

00:20:20.940 --> 00:20:24.070
I am holding high hopes for him.

00:20:24.660 --> 00:20:26.160
Is that supposed to be present progressive?

00:20:31.410 --> 00:20:33.000
Starting from square one.

00:20:34.040 --> 00:20:36.670
The same thing as what I've been doing.

00:20:38.170 --> 00:20:39.170
No.

00:20:39.590 --> 00:20:44.180
I wanted to connect with people,
laugh from the bottom of my heart...

00:20:45.180 --> 00:20:47.720
...enjoy my life with everyone.

00:20:48.810 --> 00:20:51.770
I'm glad I came to this island.

00:20:51.770 --> 00:20:56.020
Let's create a fun school life together.

00:21:10.030 --> 00:21:12.330
I'm sorry, Vice Prez.

00:21:12.910 --> 00:21:15.670
Please don't erase my precious time here.

00:21:18.500 --> 00:21:19.920
Hasekura-kun...

00:21:20.840 --> 00:21:23.630
I came to this school because I got sick of transferring schools.

00:21:23.630 --> 00:21:26.930
I don't want to repeat the same thing anymore.

00:21:28.930 --> 00:21:30.720
You're so pessimistic.

00:21:32.060 --> 00:21:38.270
At times like this, you should say things like "I don't want to lose any more bonds."

00:21:42.070 --> 00:21:44.190
Please let me become a part of the Student Council.

00:21:57.920 --> 00:22:02.590
I should construct my own school days...

00:22:05.220 --> 00:22:09.680
...on this new stage called the
Student Council of Shuchikan Academy.

00:22:11.070 --> 00:22:18.410
I miss you

00:22:11.070 --> 00:22:18.410
I miss you.

00:22:28.920 --> 00:22:38.560
Mabushii kurai e ni kaita jikan nano

00:22:28.920 --> 00:22:38.560
Just like in a perfect painting,

00:22:38.560 --> 00:22:43.310
Sou ima ha...

00:22:38.560 --> 00:22:43.310
Now is a dazzling moment.

00:22:47.610 --> 00:22:57.370
Kawari hajimeta machinami ni me wo sorashi

00:22:47.610 --> 00:22:57.370
I look away from the city that's starting to change

00:22:57.370 --> 00:23:03.080
Omoide ha tada iuno

00:22:57.370 --> 00:23:03.080
And my memories whisper to me, saying,

00:23:03.080 --> 00:23:10.210
Soko de tomadou dake

00:23:03.080 --> 00:23:10.210
You're only at a loss.

00:23:10.210 --> 00:23:12.180
I miss you

00:23:12.180 --> 00:23:16.470
Omoi wo sono mama dakishimete

00:23:12.180 --> 00:23:16.470
Hold on to your feelings.

00:23:16.470 --> 00:23:18.390
I miss you

00:23:18.390 --> 00:23:22.690
Kawaranu omoi wo shiritai no

00:23:18.390 --> 00:23:22.690
I want to know how you've always felt.

00:23:22.690 --> 00:23:24.600
I miss you

00:23:24.600 --> 00:23:28.360
Negatteru kara

00:23:24.600 --> 00:23:28.360
I'll always long for you, so...

00:23:28.900 --> 00:23:34.360
I miss you...

00:23:41.940 --> 00:23:45.110
What awaited me on the new stage was...

00:23:46.730 --> 00:23:48.990
Polishing the floor?

00:23:50.780 --> 00:23:54.530
This is always the first task newcomers get.

00:23:54.530 --> 00:23:56.620
It's a school tradition.

00:23:56.820 --> 00:23:58.450
Stop lying, Nii-san!

00:23:59.660 --> 00:24:01.910
President!

00:24:04.460 --> 00:24:06.000
Secret

00:24:04.460 --> 00:24:06.000
Sports festival
enactment guidelines

00:24:04.460 --> 00:24:06.000
Shuuchikan Academy

00:24:04.460 --> 00:24:06.000
Student Council

00:24:06.000 --> 00:24:20.060
「The Newcomer」

00:24:06.130 --> 00:24:20.060
Fourth Episode

00:24:07.420 --> 00:24:09.050
Two rather than one.

00:24:09.050 --> 00:24:11.130
Three rather than two.

00:24:11.130 --> 00:24:14.430
Many more rather than three.

00:24:14.430 --> 00:24:20.060
The overwhelming wind of spring is warm just like a blowball.
